OL,3,GNEWSATortured man's death in high-rise
OL,4,Aflat plunge could have been avoided -
OL,5,Ainquiry
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe death of a man who plunged from a
OL,8,Fhigh-rise flat - after the possible
OL,9,Flocation of screams for help were
OL,10,Fwrongly recorded in a 999 call - could
OL,11,Fhave been prevented, a sheriff has
OL,12,Fruled.
OL,14,FJamie Forbes, 37, was held against his
OL,15,Fwill and tortured in 18-floor
OL,16,FElphinstone Court in Aberdeen for two
OL,17,Fdays in January 2024.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
PN,42402
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F424A1791546967
OL,1,W5j 5Qwsj#%7k"k#j  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%-. * *,$%** %-& (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSATortured man's death in high-rise
OL,4,Aflat plunge could have been avoided -
OL,5,Ainquiry
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen police had carried out
OL,8,Fdoor-to-door inquiries they were not
OL,9,Fable to trace where the cries had come
OL,10,Ffrom. Forbes then fell from a 12th
OL,11,Ffloor window.
OL,13,FFollowing a fatal accident inquiry
OL,14,F(FAI), Sheriff Principal Andrew Miller
OL,15,Fsaid the death "might realistically"
OL,16,Fhave been prevented. He called for new
OL,17,Fguidance for Police Scotland call
OL,18,Fhandlers in the hope of avoiding a
OL,19,Frepeat.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
